      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُحْوَرُّ القِدْرِ</span></b>  <i>The whiteness of the froth,</i> or <i>of
the scum, of the cooking-pot.</i> (S.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَفْنَةٌ مُحْوَرَّةٌ</span>,
[in the copies of the K, erroneously, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُحَوَّرَةٌ</span>,] <i>A
bowl whitened by</i> [<i>containing</i>] <i>camel's hump,</i>
(S, L, K,) or <i>its fat.</i> (A.)

